  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ドリルのように　からだを　かいてん\nしながら　あいてに　たいあたりする。\nきゅうしょに　あたりやすい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "드릴처럼 몸을 회전시켜서\n상대에게 몸통박치기한다.\n급소에 맞기 쉽다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "像鑽頭一樣旋轉身體，\n猛烈地撞擊對手。\n容易擊中要害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur tourne sur lui-même comme une perceuse\net se jette sur l’ennemi. Taux de critiques élevé.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender rammt das Ziel, während er seinen Körper\nwie einen Bohrer dreht. Hohe Volltrefferquote.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario golpea usando su cuerpo como un taladro.\nSuele ser crítico.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa si scaglia sul bersaglio ruotando su se stesso\ncome un trapano perforante. Probabile brutto colpo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user crashes into its target while rotating its\nbody like a drill. Critical hits land more easily.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ドリルのように　体を　回転しながら\n相手に　体当たりする。\n急所に　当たりやすい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "像钢钻一样，\n一边旋转身体一边撞击对手。\n容易击中要害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario golpea usando su cuerpo como un taladro.\nSuele ser crítico.",
      "version_group": {
